{"server":"tw","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_08_beg","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_08","title":"羅德島大食堂","storyCode":"DT-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"cd04949f36f0c55cbd83456222789b4e02779c592a400b5b1871a8d079f5719f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"終於登上了羅德島的小隊幾人再次追上了刻俄柏，但是眼前的小刻似乎變得有點奇怪……","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"匯總一下我們一路上收集的有關羅德島的情報吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，大鮑勃和大祭司都認為羅德島可以幫助我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其次，小刻也說這裡有個叫作“博士”的人一定知道怎麼解決我們的問題……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我們這次好像終於真的接近那艘艦船了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望那裡真的有能解決我們問題的方法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們快過來看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"narration","text":"在奇爾查克的呼喊下，三人走到了懸崖邊，那一瞬間，他們就理解了奇爾查克的語氣為什麼會有點著急。\n那是一艘過於巨大的陸上艦船。\n在陸地上航行，卻比他們見過的任何一艘水上船隻都要龐大。\n一座鋼鐵巨構。一座城市。一座……迷宮。\n這就是——“羅德島”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真的是一艘在陸地行駛的艦船啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們真的能在那裡找到回去的路嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，我覺得我們應該考慮的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該怎麼進去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡我甚至看不見它的入口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們看！那邊好像有一支隊伍在靠近羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來好像是一支商隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"商隊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我們去和他們聊聊吧？看他們是否願意帶我們進去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodeslowerdeck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先鋒幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先鋒幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。對了，我們剛剛還遇到了四個來求助的人，穿著打扮都蠻奇怪的，說是和刻俄柏認識，想讓羅德島幫他們回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？回家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先鋒幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是這個意思，總之辛苦你給他們帶一下路，我去和外勤部交接了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯小隊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們是專門來羅德島求助的，應該是要找博士或是阿米婭吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……小刻倒是說過“博士”，我們可能是要找這個人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能帶我們去見這個博士嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我還需要確認下你們的身分，你們先跟我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦……！不好意思，我的東西掉了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《鮑勃的美食指南》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們認識大鮑勃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們來這裡吃到的第一頓飯就是他做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能把那樣堅硬的蟲子處理成一道道美味的食物，老夫很敬佩那個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了……原來他說的“那些朋友”就是你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫泥岩，大鮑勃跟我講過你們。當初他們剛決定不再當傭兵，想要換一個活法，但完全不知道開農場的事行不行得通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒野上的農場經常會遭到洗劫，大鮑勃也不認識幾個做生意的人，啤酒做出來也不知道好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你們當時吃他的料理的樣子很幸福，給了他不少信心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫當時並沒有看出來他這樣的窘迫……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……那他現在怎麼樣……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，我們也很久沒見過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是聽說他後來源石蟲啤酒廠經營得很好，賺了不少錢，也過上好日子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但後來又聽說好像是賺錢的時候得罪了當地政府，說是稅務還是什麼問題，被關進監獄裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"監獄？那他們現在還好嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前段時間又聽說他們好像越獄還是保釋出來了，人沒什麼問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越獄啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再聽說到的就是他們好像在薩米開了家雜貨店，生意不錯呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是……很有毅力地在生活啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，先跟我來吧，我們坐電梯上去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"電梯……？就是這個鐵盒子嗎……？它怎麼用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來也像是一個魔法器具……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們先進，我們去一層，稍等，我拿個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯小隊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼一開門全都變了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是哪裡？剛剛發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼這裡看起來更像是個迷宮啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾爾啟","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……果然是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是薩米的獨眼巨人……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獨眼巨人？！為什麼奇爾查克你會——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你出現在這裡，該不會是因為你又看到了什麼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾爾啟","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾爾啟","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你們前進的道路上，有著火光、衝擊……以及兇惡的獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你知道刻俄柏或博士在哪裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾爾啟","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刻俄柏剛剛回到羅德島，現在應該在訓練室，在那個方位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾爾啟","speakerId":"avg_npc_969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士……請原諒我暫時不能告訴你什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們……要先過去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩好像已經徹底和我們走散了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是那位小姐說的訓練室了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡好像沒什麼人……那邊倒是有一個好大的怪東西……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還在這幹嘛？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，大祭司？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，你有看到刻俄柏嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她剛才還在這裡，不過已經跑走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們想見到那個小傢伙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就別囉唆了，快點都過來，坐進這台機器裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？啊……好、好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，我們得到消息，好像有走失的訪客往這邊來了，你有看到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？我沒看到，我們正在這邊做新型號大醜的抗衝擊安全測試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"建議你們離遠一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞定，祖瑪瑪，準備就緒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"駕駛艙內的萊歐斯小隊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼好像看到裡面有人被炸飛了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定你看到有人被炸飛了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咦……消失了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我真的看錯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，去別的地方找吧，你要找的人不在這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你這完全是公報私仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們燉了我一次，我炸他們一次，也算是禮尚往來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你把他們弄哪裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想要找刻俄柏，我就送他們去找刻俄柏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1429_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是沒有騙他們喔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"narration","text":"從爆炸中回過神來，四人發現自己不知何時飄在了有些眼熟的半空之中，並且開始往下墜。\n正下方，竟然是熟悉的婆山鎮，而黎正用古怪的眼神看著他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯小隊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊啊啊，救命——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"四人在空中張牙舞爪卻束手無策。\n不過，他們馬上發現，自己的正下方，並不是地面，而是一口深不見底的井。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們並沒有與地面親密接觸，而是直接摔入了井中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"……雖然方法有點粗暴，不過，她這也算是送各位一程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"有緣再會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻又跑到廚房來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這次她的樣子好像有點奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——這次她回來之後變得有點沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我去和她聊聊天吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼了，是身體不舒服嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……我也不知道怎麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到本艦後，就覺得身體怪怪的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這樣，我們去做一次全面檢查好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道，但是，我覺得我應該一個人靜靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……那你先去休息一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——我的屁股……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是……廚房？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狙擊幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，站在我身後！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，大祭司把我們送到了不太好的地方……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司？你們到底——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是小刻去休息的房間！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們快去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們提到了小刻，我們也快跟去看一看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這……這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻，是你嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肚子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……這到底是怎麼回事？這是我們認識的小刻嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我能從她的情緒感覺到，她依然是我們認識的小刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她在克制，但是，她快要忍不住了……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……這是我們認識的小刻嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好帥！小刻，你原來還有這種本領！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在是說這些的時候嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須想辦法救救小刻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"幾位客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"聽你們剛才說的話，我可以理解為你們是關心小刻的狀況而來到這裡的，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們來這裡是為了能找到回到我們那個世界的方法……但是我們也很擔心小刻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，現在先讓我們放下一些疑問，一起壓制住小刻吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的話，事情會變得一發不可收拾的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，暫時聯手吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
